#
# What a country's ISO territory code implies: where Arch's mirror list calls
# it, and the time zone it keeps. code is what a locale ends in (de_DE -> DE).
# country is spelled exactly as reflector spells it — a "-" means Arch has no
# mirror there, so only the time zone is of use. time zone is a suggestion,
# not an answer: the row the time zone question opens on, one per country
# even where it keeps several.
#
